Recommends: pciutils
Description: Hardware Power & Voltage Telemetry Monitor with Desktop Panel Indicator
 Real-time hardware telemetry tool designed for PC builders, overclockers,
 and multi-GPU AI/rendering workstations. Features:
  * Native GTK3 and Cairo anti-aliased dual real-time charts.
  * Live ATX +12V rail voltage stability monitoring (11.4V - 12.6V margin).
  * Per-GPU power draw (NVIDIA, AMD Radeon, Intel Arc) and combined wattage.
  * Seamless Ubuntu desktop top-panel indicator via AyatanaAppIndicator.
  * Built-in motherboard Super I/O DMI database and heuristic 12V detector.
  * Crash-resilient session CSV logging with zero-loss flushing.
